    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d305-a4">

                <pb facs="0664" n="580" sameAs="frus:frus1886/pg580"/>

                <head>B.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">To-Day</hi>,
                            <date calendar="gregorian" when="1886-01-11"><hi rendition="#italic">the
                                11th of January</hi>, 1886</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I, Santaña Perez, state unknowingly we have met on the Haros River with the force
                    of Americans and of Indian soldiers, we coming the Mexicans, have fired, that
                    without turning back any of us, for we could not see at the time.</p>
                <closer><signed><list>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Captain</hi> CRAWFORD.</item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lieut</hi>. MAUS.</item>
                            <item>SANTAÑA PEREZ.</item>
                        </list></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
